  m_text: 'Z - Zoom

    Zoom in to inspect objects and details more closely.


    LMB
    - Interact / Skip / Fire

    Interact with objects, skip dialogue, or fire your
    weapon when authorized.


    RMB - Use / Flip Page

    Perform contextual actions,
    use devices, or turn pages in documents.


    Q -Place Item / Return camera
    / Stand up

    Return the held item to its original position or your view, or
    stand up from chair.


    WASD - Move

    Move through the environment and
    navigate your surroundings.'
