    your weapon when authorized.\n\nRMB \u2014 Use / Flip Page\nPerform contextual
    actions, use devices, or turn pages in documents.\n\nQ \u2014 Place Item / Return
    camera / Stand up\nReturn the held item to its original position or your view,
    or stand up from chair.\n\nWASD \u2014 Move\nMove through the environment and
    navigate your surroundings."
